	(text "The antenna is right-hand circular polarized (RHCP) and has a peak gain of 3 dBic. The antenna\nis insensitive to surroundings and has high tolerance against frequency detuning. However, the\nantenna gain and radiation efficiency may be reduced on a small ground plane. The optimal radiation\npattern is achieved with a 50 x 50 mm2 ground plane."
